OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,6,FChangeable through midweek, with rain
OL,7,Fcrossing Wales on Wednesday and
OL,8,Ffurther rain likely later Thursday
OL,9,Fevening after a settled day. Friday
OL,10,Fshould turn drier and brighter, with
OL,11,Ftemperatures near average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
